/**************************/
/* STYLING - GENERAL */
/**************************/


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]


*{
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

@font-face {
    font-family: "Courier Prime";
    src: url("fonts/CourierPrime-Regular.ttf");
}

body {
  font-family: "Courier Prime";
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  height: 100%;
  width:auto;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

html, body{
  height:100%;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}

main{
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    width:auto;
}

a{
    text-decoration: none;
}

.nav-img{
  width: 250px;
  height: 80px;
  padding: 10px 10px 0px 10px;
  margin: 10px 10px 10px 0px;
}

li:hover{
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.logo-img{
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    margin: 0px 10px 10px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
}


h1{
    display: inline-block;
    color: black;
    font-size: 50px;
    padding: 20px 20px 20px 20px;
    background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
    margin: 20px 0px 10px 0px;
    font-family: "TypoSlab Main";
    border-radius: 20px;
}

.buttons{
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    }

.button{
    margin: 15px 40px;
    padding: 15px 60px;
    font-size: 25px;
    width: 250px;
    background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
    color: black;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: "Courier Prime";
    border-color: purple;
}


.button:hover{
    cursor: pointer;
    background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);
}

.main-div{
  color: black;
  background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
  padding: 10px 10px 10px 10px;
  margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
}

.main-div a{
  color: blue;
  background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
}

.main-div a:hover{
  color: blue;
}


footer{
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background-color:rgb(188, 186, 186) ;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  margin-top: auto;
}

footer h3{
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 40px;
  font-family: "TypoSlab Main";
  color: black;
}

footer img{
  width: 150px;
}

.col-1{
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-around;
  color: black;
  font-family: "Courier Prime";
  padding: 10px 10px 15px 10px;
}
.col-1 p{
  text-align: center;
}

#story a.link-external:after {
    content: "";
}

.passage[data-passage="landing"] {
  background-image: url("src/assets/img/woods1_edited.png");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

/**************************/
/* STYLING - MUSIC TUTORIAL */
/**************************/

.passage[data-passage="music tutorial"] .music-tut-img{
  width: 300px;
  height: auto;
}

.passage[data-passage="music tutorial"] a img{
  width: 40px;
  height: auto;
}


/**************************/
/* STYLING - PASSAGE #1 */
/**************************/

.passage[data-passage="name_set1"]{
  background-image:url("src/assets/img/bw_gradient.jpg");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

.passage[data-passage="wakeup3"] img{
  width:800px;
}

.passage[data-passage="wakeup"] img{
  width:800px;
}

.passage[data-passage="tear_path"] img{
  width:800px;
}

/**************************/
/* STYLING - INVENTORY*/
/**************************/

.inventory_layout{
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 20px;
}

.main_img{
  width: 300px;
  height: auto;
}

.inventory{
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.hidden {
  display: none !important;
}

.inventory_slot{
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  border-radius:10px
}

.inventory_img{
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
}

.inventory_header{
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 16px;
}



/**************************/
/* START OF PRE-NARRATIVE */
/**************************/


:: name_set1
<<audio "title" volume 0.05 loop play>>
/* Gradient from black to white after some scrolling, then the below.*/


















































































































<<type 20ms>>
\> You're finally here.

\> This story is about you. What should we call you?


\>> I think... I think you can call me <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_confirm">>

<</type>>

:: name_confirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to false>>

<<type 20ms>>
\> $name. A lot is going to happen, $name.

\> If it's any consolation, it's all in your hands.


\>> [[[Wait. I think I might be someone else?|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[.. What do you mean? What is this?|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: name_reselect

<<type 20ms>>

\> It's so easy to forget, isn't it? Who are you, then?

\>> <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_reconfirm">> That's it.


<</type>>

:: name_reconfirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to true>>

<<type 20ms>>
\> You know this for sure, $name?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[.. One more time.|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[Yes. I do.|question2]]]

<</type>>

:: question2
<<set $prewakeup_re to false>>
<<type 20ms>>  /* REQUIRES VARIABLES TO CONTROL THE BOTTOM TWO OPTIONS */
<<if $name_resel is true and not $customEnrapture>>

\> Wonderful. We need to know - what enraptures you?

<<elseif $customEnrapture and not $scarePrompt is true>>

\> Oh, I don't doubt it. Try again though.

<<elseif $scarePrompt is true>>

\> We must be, yes. We're sorry, but this is the way forward. For you.

<<elseif $name_resel is false>>

\> You'll see in due time. For now, we must know - what enraptures you?
<<else>>

<</if>>
/* Need to turn these into buttons then set a variable based on the answer IF it ends up doing anything */
\>> [[Pure darkness as far as I can see.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A grating, droning noise - somehow from everywhere and nowhere.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[A cold so intense, I can't even feel it.|pre-wakeup]]

\>> [[Losing myself in a tangle of endless corridors.|pre-wakeup]]

<<if not $customEnrapture>>
\>> No.. It must be <<textbox "$customEnrapture" "" "question2">>
<</if>>
<<if not $scarePrompt is true>>
\>> [[You're starting to scare me??|question2][$scarePrompt to true]]
<</if>>


<</type>>

:: pre-wakeup
<<if $prewakeup_re is false>>
<<type 20ms>>
\> Wonderful. You're doing so well. Are you ready?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[Yes.|wakeup]]]

\>> [[[No! What is this? What's happening??|pre-wakeup][$prewakeup_re to true]]]

<</type>>
<<else>>
\> Wonderful. You're doing so well. Are you ready?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[Yes.|wakeup]]]

\>> [[[No! What is this? What's happening??|pre-wakeup][$prewakeup_re to true]]]
<</if>>

/*******************/
/* AFTER WAKING UP */
/*******************/

:: wakeup
<<audio ":playing" fadeout>>
\> Your eyes open.

[img[You look up at the trees.|src/assets/img/act1/wakeup_still.png]]


\> You must've overslept. You try to remember what you were doing before this and draw... nothing. Absolutely nothing. Where are you?


\> A thousand thoughts race through your mind.


\> [[Get up.|wakeup2]] Where are you?

:: wakeup2
<video width="800px" autoplay muted>
  <source src="src/assets/video/getup_pt1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Your browser does not support video.
</video>
<<timed 2s>> <<audio "shuffle_noise_SFX" time 16 volume 0.7 play>> <</timed>>
<<timed 10333ms>> <<goto wakeup3>> <</timed>>

:: wakeup3

[img[The trees stand before you.|src/assets/img/act1/getup_still2.png]]

\> Okay. Looking around, you're confident:



\> You've never been here before.


\>  ...


\>> [[Try to find something, anything.|wakeup4]]

:: wakeup4
<video width="800px" autoplay muted>
  <source src="src/assets/video/wander1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Your browser does not support video.
</video>
<<set $wanderCount to 0>>
<<cacheaudio footsteps_dirt src/assets/audio/footsteps.mp3>>
<<timed 2s>>
<<audio "footsteps_dirt" play>>
<<next 5s>> \> [[You wander.|tear_path]]
<</timed>>

::tear_path

[img[Something is in front of you.|src/assets/img/act1/woodsTear.png]]
<<if $wanderCount is 0>>
\> You try to wrap your head around whats happening in front of you. There must be a way to explain what you're seeing in front of you.


\> You aren't dreaming.

<<type 40ms>>
\> Every. Bit. Of your understanding of the world, your world, fails you. You're at a loss.
... Is this even your world anymore?


\>> [[.. Let me try a different direction.|wander][$wanderCount to $wanderCount + 1]]

\>>[[What's that behind it? Let me take a look.|pre_tutroom1]]<</type>>
<<elseif $wanderCount is 1>>
\> You're back.


\> You must've gotten turned around?


\>> [[.. Wander. Again.|wander][$wanderCount to $wanderCount + 1]]

\>>[[Go forwards.|pre_tutroom1]]

<<elseif $wanderCount is 2>>
\> .. Okay. It must be really easily to get turned around here.


\>> [[.. Wander, again.|wander][$wanderCount to $wanderCount + 1]]

\>>[[Go forwards.|pre_tutroom1]]

<<elseif $wanderCount is 3>>
\> There's no way.


\>> [[.. Pick a direction, and walk in the straightest line you can.|wander][$wanderCount to $wanderCount + 1]]

\>>[[Go forwards.|pre_tutroom1]]

<<else>>
\> ...


\>> [[Again.|wander][$wanderCount to $wanderCount + 1]]

\>>[[Go forwards.|pre_tutroom1]]

<</if>>

:: wander
<video width="800px" autoplay muted>
  <source src="src/assets/video/woods_walk.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Your browser does not support video.
</video>

<<timed 3s>> \> [[You walk away for a while.|tear_path]] <</timed>>

::pre_tutroom1
\> You take a breath and step forward-
<<timed 3s>> <<goto pre_tutroom2>> <</timed>>

::pre_tutroom2
<video width="800px" autoplay muted>
  <source src="src/assets/video/woodsTearVID.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Your browser does not support video.
</video>
<<timed 1600ms>> <<goto starting_room>> <</timed>>



